{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-65787a402898","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-65787a402898","name":"蒜香黄油虾","category":"aquatic","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/aquatic/%E8%92%9C%E9%A6%99%E9%BB%84%E6%B2%B9%E8%99%BE/%E8%92%9C%E9%A6%99%E9%BB%84%E6%B2%B9%E8%99%BE.md","blob_sha":"5cbf0061d5934f6cfaeeecbce3bb8ba3182b3dbc","details":{"introduction":"蒜香黄油虾是一道经典的西式海鲜菜，虾肉鲜嫩弹牙，被浓郁的蒜香和黄油包裹，带有淡淡柠檬清香。虾肉富含优质蛋白，搭配黄油提供能量，适合快速补充营养。做法简单，只需几种常见食材，新手也能轻松上手，从备料到出锅大约二十分钟。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 大虾（推荐黑虎虾或基围虾）\n- 无盐黄油（推荐安佳）\n- 大蒜\n- 白葡萄酒（可选）\n- 柠檬\n- 平底煎锅\n- 厨房用夹"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"每次制作前需要确定计划做几份。一份正好够 1-2 人食用。\n\n每份：\n\n- 大虾 8-10 只（约 200g）\n- 无盐黄油 30g\n- 大蒜 4 瓣（约 20g）\n- 白葡萄酒 15ml（可选）\n- 柠檬 1/4 个\n- 橄榄油 10ml"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 大虾去头去壳留尾，用牙签挑去虾线，洗净后用厨房纸吸干水分\n2. 大蒜切成蒜末，备用\n3. 中火加热平底锅，放入 10ml 橄榄油\n4. 油热后放入大虾，每面煎 1-1.5 分钟至变色，取出备用\n5. 同一锅中加入黄油，融化后放入蒜末，小火炒香（约 30 秒）\n6. 如使用白葡萄酒，此时加入并煮至酒精挥发（约 1 分钟）\n7. 将虾放回锅中，与蒜香黄油酱汁翻炒均匀（约 1 分钟）\n8. 挤入柠檬汁，翻炒均匀后立即关火\n9. 装盘，淋上锅中剩余酱汁"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 虾不宜过度烹饪，否则会变硬"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：去壳生虾仁350g、无盐黄油30g、去皮大蒜25g、小葱10g、食盐2g；整份约370g。去头去壳虾仁，无额外可选面包配料，黄油蒜汁全食。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":149.472973,"protein_g":19.561622,"carbohydrate_g":2.43973,"fat_g":7.097027},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/175179/nutrients","version":"e49d0c251f15ddaa","fdc_ids":[175179,173430,169230,170005,173468]},"profile_id":"family-65787a402898-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-65787a402898","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-65787a402898","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"pan_fry","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-65787a402898-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"shrimp","grams":350},{"key":"butter","grams":30},{"key":"garlic","grams":25},{"key":"scallion","grams":10},{"key":"salt","grams":2}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"data_version":"e49d0c251f15ddaa","completeness":"complete","rules_version":"nutrition-1.6.0","details":{"path":"assets/nutrition/family-65787a402898-v1.71305abbfc644906.json","bytes":24671,"sha256":"71305abbfc64490691746fceef64dc8dc0f85b38623588f2da919d407669b10d"},"requires_independent_match":true},"nutrition_profiles":[{"id":"family-65787a402898-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-65787a402898","recipe_blob_sha":"5cbf0061d5934f6cfaeeecbce3bb8ba3182b3dbc","version":"1","data_version":"e49d0c251f15ddaa","status":"reference","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","estimate_confidence":"low","final_weight":{"grams":370,"method":"household_recipe_assumption","basis":"standard_recipe_assumption","is_measured":false,"servings":{"min":2,"max":3},"evidence":"项目按2–3人家庭份明确设定成品370g，非实测或USDA出成率；原料与成品重分别保存。"},"retention_correction":"not_applied","basis":"per_100g","completeness":"complete","scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：去壳生虾仁350g、无盐黄油30g、去皮大蒜25g、小葱10g、食盐2g；整份约370g。去头去壳虾仁，无额外可选面包配料，黄油蒜汁全食。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-65787a402898","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"pan_fry","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-65787a402898-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"shrimp","grams":350},{"key":"butter","grams":30},{"key":"garlic","grams":25},{"key":"scallion","grams":10},{"key":"salt","grams":2}],"excludes":["不同主料、品种、品牌、用量、含水量或额外配料","带骨带壳毛重、丢弃汤汁或锅中残油的实际摄入计算","将家庭份成品重量假设当作实测或USDA出成率"]},"per_